{
  "id": "section-sewers-table",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "sewers table (d6)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,22,40]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1 You find an entrance to the sewers. You may ignore this\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,40,98]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "or enter (play event #11 if you do).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,98,135]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,135,137]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "As you walk close to the sewers, you are attacked by a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,137,192]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "giant rat thing. It fears fire: if you have a lit torch,a lighter,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,192,259]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "or use a Molotov cocktail, ignore this encounter.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,259,309]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Giant Rat Thing: L3 Animal, 4 Life, damage 1. If you have a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,309,369]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "dose of rat poison and 1 Food point, you may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,369,414]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "automatically inflict 2 damage to the creature. If you roll a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,414,476]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1 on a Defense roll, you must save vs L5 Infection (add +1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,476,535]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "if you have the Resilient Skill, +2 if you have it at Expert\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,535,596]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "level) or be infected. If you are infected, you lose 1 Life\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,596,656]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "every time you cross a box until you reach a Safe House or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,656,715]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you use a dose from a first aid kit to clean the infected\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,715,773]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "wound.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,773,780]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3 You find something. Roll on the Random Objects or on\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,780,835]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the Useful Stuff table (your choice).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,835,873]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,873,875]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You see shadows of people moving through the sewers.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,875,928]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Gain 1 Clue. If you want to follow them and investigate,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,928,985]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "play event #12.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,985,1001]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,1001,1003]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You find a section of the sewers that can become a Safe\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,1003,1059]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "House if you first clean it up from the 2d6 zombies (L3,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,1059,1116]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Slow, Undead, 1 Life each, damage 1) occupying it.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,1116,1167]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,1167,1169]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You have found a hell gate! You may attempt a ritual to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,1169,1225]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "close it if you have the necessary spell components and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,1225,1281]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "book describing the ritual. In any case, there is a 3 in 6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,1281,1340]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "chance that the gate is guarded by a random monster\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,1340,1392]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sewers-table:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "from the demonic horror table.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[52,1392,1422]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    52
  ]
}
